  anything outside the inner safe zone is cropped on some phones and not others.

  Material Symbols are published on a 960x960 grid with a -960 y-origin, so the group places
  and scales the art rather than the path being rewritten: swapping in another symbol is then
  a matter of replacing one attribute.
